          "overview": "## Blawgy MCP Server\n\nBlawgy's official remote MCP server lets an AI agent run an SEO blog end to end. Blawgy researches keywords, writes SEO articles with images and internal links, and publishes them to WordPress, Shopify, Webflow, Wix, Framer, Ghost and Duda. Through this server an agent can read Google Search Console traffic, rankings and indexing status, research keywords, manage the content plan (add keywords, move dates, pause or resume, posts per week), write and edit articles, draft and approve refreshes of live posts, and manage guardrails, images, products, location pages, settings, webhooks and team members. Authentication is OAuth 2.1 with PKCE and dynamic client registration, or a Blawgy API key sent as a bearer token. MCP access is included on every paid Blawgy plan; plans include a free trial.",
